# THE redirect map — single source of truth for every legacy URL (oxjob #354).
#
# Two legacy URL sets land here:
#   1. Zendesk KB paths (/hc/en-us/articles/<id>-Title) — help.openalex.org was
#      the Zendesk Guide host before this site.
#   2. Old Mintlify dev-docs paths — developers.openalex.org/* 301s to
#      help.openalex.org/<same path> via a zone-level wildcard rule, then this
#      file re-routes any path whose new-IA home differs.
#
# Rules: explicit 301s, one line per legacy URL, filled in during the migration
# grind. External targets allowed (the ~19 Unsub articles -> docs.unsub.org).
# Cloudflare Pages limit: 2,000 static rules; we need ~200.
#
# Format: /old-path /new-path 301
